File Index

/attack.test.ts
Purpose: Tests attack and ability resolution logic including damage calculation and status effects.

/attack.ts
Purpose: Handles attack and ability resolution logic for game tokens.

/board.ts
Purpose: Provides board geometry, coordinate operations, and movement patterns for a grid-based game.

