Purpose: Tests the damage calculation logic including armor, terrain, resistances, and magical effects.

/damage.ts
Purpose: Centralized damage calculation and balancing constants for game combat system.

/index.ts
Purpose: Centralized export of all game rule resolvers and utilities for squadron combat simulation.

/line-of-sight.test.ts
Purpose: Tests line of sight calculations and tile traversal utilities.

/line-of-sight.ts
Purpose: Determines if two coordinates have line-of-sight using a supercover algorithm.

/movement.test.ts
Purpose: Tests movement logic and pathfinding for game units with various terrain and blocking conditions.

/movement.ts
Purpose: Defines token movement rules and calculates legal move destinations based on terrain and unit properties.

/saves.test.ts
Purpose: Tests the save calculation and rolling logic for a game system.

/saves.ts
Purpose: Handles spell save mechanics and landing probability calculations.

/squadron.ts
Purpose: Aggregate squadron stats from member unit templates using a data provider.

/targeting.test.ts
Purpose: Tests targeting logic including attack patterns, line-of-sight, and splash damage calculations.

/targeting.ts
Purpose: Handles token targeting logic including attack patterns, line-of-sight, and legal targets determination.

/turn-order.test.ts
Purpose: Tests turn order and side cycling logic for a tactical game.

/turn-order.ts
Purpose: Determines turn order and next active side for game tokens based on initiative.

/victory.test.ts
